  "description": "\".NET Thread.Terminate\" is a partial implementation of a bigger project [Untitled](https://github.com/Emine3/Untitled) under development. It offers capability to perform native operations such as termination on any managed threads on both .NET and .NET Framework. This project serves as a proof of concept demonstrating the power of the upcoming project.",
